TI  - Transparent maintenance alerts for rural electrification projects using Electroconvlstm -SHAP hybrids
T2  - INTELLIGENT DECISION TECHNOLOGIES-NETHERLANDS
LA  - English
KW  - predictive maintenance
KW  - ElectroConvLSTM
KW  - rural electrification
KW  - deep learning
