TI  - Digital Twin-Enabled Building Information Modeling-Internet of Things (BIM-IoT) Framework for Optimizing Indoor Thermal Comfort Using Machine Learning
T2  - BUILDINGS
LA  - English
KW  - thermal comfort
KW  - machine learning
