TI  - A comprehensive analysis of the implications of artificial intelligence adoption on employee social well-being in South African facility management organizations
T2  - JOURNAL OF CORPORATE REAL ESTATE
LA  - English
KW  - South Africa
KW  - Employee
KW  - Artificial intelligence
