TI  - DeepHealth: A Self-Attention Based Method for Instant Intelligent Predictive Maintenance in Industrial Internet of Things
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON INDUSTRIAL INFORMATICS
LA  - English
KW  - Maintenance engineering
KW  - Vibrations
KW  - Monitoring
KW  - Predictive models
KW  - Data models
KW  - Training
KW  - Data acquisition
