TI  - A Cyber-Physical Architecture for Manufacturing Process Optimization Enabled by Integration of ANSI/ISA 95 with Native Machine Metadata
T2  - 2025 INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON SUSTAINABLE TECHNOLOGIES FOR HUMANITY AND SMART WORLD, HSWTECH
