TI  - Financial Loss Assessment for Weather-Induced Railway Accidents Based on a Deep Learning Technique Using Weather Indicators
T2  - APPLIED SCIENCES-BASEL
LA  - English
KW  - weather-induced railroad accident
KW  - weather indicators
KW  - financial losses
KW  - deep learning algorithm
KW  - loss prediction
KW  - CRASH INJURY SEVERITY
KW  - RAILROAD GRADE CROSSINGS
