TI  - A unified intelligence-augmented framework for building audits via physical and virtual inspection
T2  - EXPERT SYSTEMS WITH APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Pre-demolition audit
KW  - User requirements
KW  - Interactive machine learning
