TI  - Methodology for Thermal Analysis of Induction Motors with Infrared Thermography Considering Camera Location
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE IECON 2016 - 42ND ANNUAL CONFERENCE OF THE IEEE INDUSTRIAL ELECTRONICS SOCIETY
LA  - English
