TI  - Automatic Identification of Defects in External Wall Insulation Layers Based on UAV Image Recognition Technology
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF COMPUTATIONAL INTELLIGENCE AND APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - UAV
KW  - defect identification
KW  - multi-scale fusion
KW  - mobile net
