TI  - I-FCSAM: An integrated framework of few-shot learning and segment anything model for vision-based indoor built environment management
T2  - ADVANCED ENGINEERING INFORMATICS
LA  - English
KW  - AECO
KW  - Computer Vision
KW  - Few-Shot Learning
KW  - Segment Anything Model
KW  - Indoor
