TI  - Integration of digital twins and physical AI in cyber-physical systems
T2  - INTELLIGENT SYSTEMS WITH APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Digital twin
KW  - Digital twins in manufacturing
KW  - Digital twins in agriculture
KW  - Digital twin system
KW  - Real-time digital twin
KW  - CHALLENGES
