TI  - Service Discovery and Provisioning in Social Digital Twin Networks: a Name-based Approach
T2  - 2024 20TH INTERNATIONAL CONFERENCE ON WIRELESS AND MOBILE COMPUTING, NETWORKING AND COMMUNICATIONS, WIMOB
LA  - English
CP  - 2024 International Conference on Wireless and Mobile Computing Networking and Communications
KW  - Digital Twin
KW  - Social Internet of Things
KW  - Information Centric Networking
