TI  - Mapping 3-D classroom seats based on partial object point cloud completion
T2  - CARTOGRAPHY AND GEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - LiDAR
KW  - point cloud completion
KW  - point cloud registration
KW  - spatial optimization
