TI  - Unlocking the Potential of Digital Twin Technology for Energy-Efficient and Sustainable Buildings: Challenges, Opportunities, and Pathways to Adoption
T2  - SUSTAINABILITY
LA  - English
KW  - digital twin
KW  - smart buildings
