TI  - From instance segmentation to physical quantification: High-resolution UAV-based dataset for façade defect assessment
T2  - AUTOMATION IN CONSTRUCTION
LA  - English
KW  - Building inspection
KW  - Unmanned aerial vehicle
KW  - Deep learning
