TI  - Analysis of the Synergistic Effect of Data Analytics and Technology Trends in the AEC/FM Industry
T2  - JOURNAL OF CONSTRUCTION ENGINEERING AND MANAGEMENT
LA  - English
KW  - ACTIVITY RECOGNITION
KW  - BIG DATA
KW  - FACILITIES MANAGEMENT
