TI  - Carbon neutrality through industry 4.0: A decision-making approach for sustainable energy efficient logistics operations
T2  - ENERGY ECONOMICS
LA  - English
KW  - Carbon neutrality
KW  - Carbon emission
KW  - Energy efficient logistics
KW  - Industry 4.0
