TI  - Making knowledge graphs work for smart manufacturing: Research topics, applications and prospects
T2  - JOURNAL OF MANUFACTURING SYSTEMS
LA  - English
KW  - Smart manufacturing
KW  - Industry 4.0
KW  - Knowledge graph
KW  - Semantic modelling under industry 4.0
