TI  - A novel autonomous staircase cleaning system with robust 3D-Deep Learning-based perception technique for Area-Coverage
T2  - EXPERT SYSTEMS WITH APPLICATIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Cleaning System
KW  - Building Maintenance
KW  - Staircase Traversing
