TI  - COMPARISON OF FIRE SUPPRESSION MATERIALS FOR ENSURING FIRE SAFETY IN ELECTRIC COMMERCIAL VEHICLE MANUFACTURING PLANTS
T2  - THERMAL SCIENCE
LA  - English
