TI  - Health Assessment Model for Data Centers Using Environmental Sensor Networks and Uninterruptible Power Supply Telemetry
T2  - SENSORS AND MATERIALS
LA  - English
KW  - UPS logs
KW  - environmental sensors
KW  - data center
KW  - AHP
