TI  - Dominant transmission route of SARS-CoV-2 and its implication to indoor environment
T2  - CHINESE SCIENCE BULLETIN-CHINESE
LA  - Chinese
KW  - COVID-19
KW  - transmission routes
KW  - airborne transmission
KW  - aerosol
KW  - indoor environment
